WEBVTT

00:01.539 --> 00:04.470
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

00:04.539 --> 00:11.539
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:11.608 --> 00:15.160
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

00:15.229 --> 00:16.987
One glorious week
辉煌的一周

00:17.056 --> 00:18.987
without being annoyed
by those two--
不生气
由那两个人——

00:19.056 --> 00:19.987
- Hey!
- 嘿！

00:20.056 --> 00:23.056
- [wailing]
- [哀号]

00:23.642 --> 00:25.125
Idiots!
白痴！

00:25.194 --> 00:27.539
both: Hi, Squidward!
两人：嗨，章鱼哥！

00:28.194 --> 00:30.470
- Whoo-hoo!
Doink.
- 呼呼！
多因克。

00:34.884 --> 00:36.746
Hold on, Squidward.
坚持住，章鱼哥。

00:36.815 --> 00:39.160
[both straining]
[双方都紧张]

00:45.125 --> 00:46.884
You should be more careful.
你应该更加小心。

00:46.953 --> 00:49.746
- Tsk-tsk-tsk.
- 啧啧啧。

00:49.815 --> 00:54.091
- Would you two go away
and stop ruining my vacation?
- 你们两个可以走开吗
别再毁了我的假期吗？

00:54.160 --> 00:55.711
- Vacation?
- 假期？

00:55.780 --> 00:59.435
Gee, I didn't think
Mr. Krabs gave us any vacation.
哎呀我没想到
蟹老板给了我们任何假期。

00:59.504 --> 01:02.539
- I found someone
to cover for me.
- 我找到了一个人
为我掩护。

01:02.608 --> 01:06.194
- One krabby patty
coming up, sir.
- 一份蟹肉饼
即将到来，先生。

01:07.022 --> 01:08.332
[groaning]
[呻吟]

01:08.401 --> 01:09.849
[sizzling]
Huh? [sniffs]
[嘶嘶声]
啊？ [嗅嗅]

01:09.918 --> 01:12.298
- Where are you going on
your vacation, Squidward?
- 你要去哪里
你的假期吗，章鱼哥？

01:12.366 --> 01:15.401
- If you must know,
I'm going to Porpoise Peak
- 如果你一定要知道的话
我要去海豚峰

01:15.470 --> 01:19.746
to bask in the melodious sounds
of the Warbling Water Lily.
沐浴在悠扬的声音中
鸣叫的睡莲。

01:19.815 --> 01:22.229
[both exclaiming]
[两人惊呼]

01:22.298 --> 01:25.366
Which only blooms once
every 500 years.
只开一次花的
每 500 年一次。

01:27.987 --> 01:30.091
And I'm going alone.
而我一个人去。

01:34.573 --> 01:36.229
- I know!
- 我知道！

01:36.298 --> 01:37.711
Patrick and I will come along
帕特里克和我会一起去

01:37.780 --> 01:40.091
and we can all
be alone together.
我们都可以
单独在一起。

01:40.160 --> 01:41.263
- Oh, no!
- 哦，不！

01:41.332 --> 01:43.539
You're not
messing up my vacation.
你不是
搞乱了我的假期。

01:43.608 --> 01:44.746
Now beat it!
现在打败它！

01:44.815 --> 01:48.263
If I don't get moving,
I'm going to miss it.
如果我不行动起来
我会想念它的。

01:48.332 --> 01:50.160
- Oh, we'll help you pack.
- 哦，我们会帮你打包。

01:50.229 --> 01:53.401
- No way.
You idiots will just break--
- 决不。
你们这些白痴只会崩溃——

01:55.677 --> 01:57.780
Everything. Oh.
一切。哦。

01:57.849 --> 01:59.470
- Hold it.
- 握住它。

02:00.642 --> 02:02.746
Forgot to pack this.
忘记打包这个了。

02:07.056 --> 02:09.194
- What, no!
Don't! Stop!
- 什么，不！
不！停止！

02:10.573 --> 02:12.125
- [chuckles]
- [轻笑]

02:12.918 --> 02:15.504
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

02:19.229 --> 02:21.470
- Oh, oh, oh!
[horns honking]
- 哦，哦，哦！
[喇叭鸣响]

02:22.780 --> 02:25.125
all: Oh!
全体：哦！

02:25.194 --> 02:27.125
- Oh, no!
- 哦，不！

02:27.194 --> 02:29.298
[together]
Whew!
[一起]
哇！

02:29.987 --> 02:30.953
[metal clanks]
[金属叮当声]

02:31.022 --> 02:32.677
[explosion]
[爆炸]

02:32.746 --> 02:33.918
[both mumbling]
[两人都嘀咕着]

02:33.987 --> 02:36.401
- You can buff that out.
- 你可以把它抛光掉。

02:37.711 --> 02:39.849
- How could--
why would--
- 怎么可能--
为什么会——

02:39.918 --> 02:41.780
I can't believe it!
我简直不敢相信！

02:41.849 --> 02:43.298
[sighs]
[叹气]

02:45.884 --> 02:50.642
I'll never see the
Warbling Water Lily bloom now.
我永远不会看到
鸣睡莲现在盛开。

02:51.677 --> 02:55.539
[groaning]
[呻吟]

02:57.470 --> 02:59.677
[groaning continues]
[呻吟继续]

03:01.194 --> 03:03.125
both: Oh!
两人：哦！

03:03.194 --> 03:06.332
Poor Squidward.
可怜的章鱼哥。

03:06.401 --> 03:10.022
- Ooh, I have an idea.
- 哦，我有一个主意。

03:10.091 --> 03:12.263
- Really?
What's that like?
- 真的吗？
那是什么样子的？

03:12.332 --> 03:14.263
- Little monsters.
- 小怪物。

03:14.332 --> 03:15.642
They ought to be locked up.
他们应该被关起来。

03:15.711 --> 03:18.539
Throw away the key, then--
[shudders]
把钥匙扔掉，然后——
[颤抖]

03:18.608 --> 03:19.711
[snoring]
[打鼾]

03:19.780 --> 03:21.504
[muttering]
Lock up...
[嘀咕]
锁起来...

03:21.573 --> 03:23.470
and throw them away.
并把它们扔掉。

03:23.539 --> 03:25.677
[pleasant music]
[悦耳的音乐]

03:25.746 --> 03:26.953
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

03:27.022 --> 03:29.918
[vocalizing]
[发声]

03:29.987 --> 03:31.884
[sniffs]
[嗅嗅]

03:31.953 --> 03:34.849
Ah! Ah!
啊!啊!

03:34.918 --> 03:37.849
[both giggling]
[两人都咯咯笑]

03:37.918 --> 03:41.160
[giggling continues]
[咯咯笑继续]

03:41.229 --> 03:42.677
[screams]
[尖叫声]

03:42.746 --> 03:44.539
Oh, oh, whew.
哦，哦，哇哦。

03:44.608 --> 03:47.298
It was only a nightmare.
这只是一场噩梦。

03:47.366 --> 03:48.298
[screams]
[尖叫声]

03:48.366 --> 03:49.711
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

03:49.780 --> 03:51.229
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

03:52.435 --> 03:54.504
- [muffled]
Good morning, Squidward.
- [低声]
早上好，章鱼哥。

03:55.918 --> 03:57.987
- Would you get out
of my bedroom?
- 你能出去吗
我的卧室？

03:58.056 --> 04:00.608
- Oh, we're not
in your bedroom, silly.
- 哦，我们不是
在你的卧室里，傻瓜。

04:00.677 --> 04:02.987
- What?
How did I get here?
- 什么？
我是怎么到这里的？

04:03.056 --> 04:04.263
- Patrick and I moved--
-帕特里克和我搬家了--

04:04.332 --> 04:06.884
- Actually, I don't care.
- 事实上，我不在乎。

04:06.953 --> 04:08.539
Humph.
哼。

04:09.056 --> 04:11.677
Goodbye, Sponge--
再见，海绵——

04:11.746 --> 04:13.780
[wailing]
[哀号]

04:19.263 --> 04:22.366
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

04:22.435 --> 04:25.435
Spongebob, why is your house
海绵宝宝，为什么是你的房子

04:25.504 --> 04:28.780
driving on the road?
开车在路上？

04:28.849 --> 04:31.642
- Because we
turned it into a RV.
- 因为我们
把它变成了一辆房车。

04:31.711 --> 04:34.091
- We didn't want you to
miss that flower blooming.
-我们不想让你这么做
怀念那朵盛开的花。

04:34.160 --> 04:35.539
- Okay.
- 好的。

04:35.608 --> 04:37.504
Hold on.
Who's driving?
坚持，稍等。
谁在开车？

04:37.573 --> 04:39.987
- It's on auto-snail.
- 这是自动蜗牛。

04:40.056 --> 04:41.401
- [meows]
- [喵]

04:42.815 --> 04:45.022
- Come on,
let's get breakfast.
- 来吧，
我们去吃早餐吧。

04:45.539 --> 04:47.504
- [soft giggling]
- [轻笑]

04:48.332 --> 04:50.022
[chuckling]
[轻笑]

04:50.091 --> 04:51.539
- [startles]
- [吃惊]

04:56.263 --> 04:58.815
Hey, this looks pretty good.
嘿，这看起来很不错。

05:03.091 --> 05:04.298
Huh?
啊？

05:06.539 --> 05:08.884
[groaning]
[呻吟]

05:10.849 --> 05:12.539
Ah.
啊。

05:14.298 --> 05:15.815
[choking]
[窒息]

05:19.504 --> 05:20.884
[inhales deeply]
[深吸一口气]

05:23.022 --> 05:24.470
- You gonna eat that?
- 你要吃那个吗？

05:29.746 --> 05:31.539
- Hey, Patrick,
let's give Gary a break.
- 嘿，帕特里克，
让我们让加里休息一下。

05:31.608 --> 05:35.608
- Disengaging auto-snail!
- 解除自动蜗牛！

05:37.539 --> 05:39.677
- [meowing]
- [喵喵叫]

05:39.746 --> 05:41.263
- Hey, hop!
Ho!
- 嘿，跳！
嗬！

05:41.332 --> 05:42.884
- [meowing]
[toy squeaking]
- [喵喵叫]
[玩具吱吱声]

05:42.953 --> 05:46.746
- Let's see what
this pineapple can do!
- 让我们看看是什么
这个菠萝可以做！

05:48.160 --> 05:50.401
Whee!
[laughs]
哎哟！
[笑]

05:50.470 --> 05:52.056
Yeah!
是的！

05:53.918 --> 05:55.815
On the road!
在路上！

05:57.401 --> 05:59.815
- We got to get off this road!
- 我们必须离开这条路！

06:01.263 --> 06:02.884
- No problem.
- 没问题。

06:08.953 --> 06:12.435
[tires screeching]
[轮胎的尖叫声]

06:15.125 --> 06:16.849
- Oh.
Hi, Squidward.
- 哦。
嗨，章鱼哥。

06:16.918 --> 06:18.884
- [wailing]
- [哀号]

06:20.263 --> 06:23.504
I'm not here!
This isn't happening!
我不在！
这不会发生！

06:24.091 --> 06:27.194
[Johann Strauss's
"The Blue Danube"]
[约翰施特劳斯的
《蓝色多瑙河》]

06:27.263 --> 06:33.470
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

06:35.608 --> 06:37.539
- [meowing]
[toy squeaking]
- [喵喵叫]
[玩具吱吱声]

06:37.608 --> 06:40.470
- Whoo-hoo!
- 呼呼！

06:44.780 --> 06:46.332
[glass smashes]
- [grunts]
[玻璃碎裂]
- [咕哝]

06:46.401 --> 06:48.194
- Ah, we're here!
- 啊，我们到了！

06:50.918 --> 06:53.160
- Huh? Huh?
[gasps]
- 啊？啊？
[喘气]

06:53.229 --> 06:55.160
[pleasant music]
[悦耳的音乐]

06:55.229 --> 06:57.780
The Warbling Water Lily!
睡莲的鸣叫！

06:58.918 --> 07:00.401
[mutters]
[嘀咕]

07:01.194 --> 07:03.263
Oh, it's so beautiful.
哦，太漂亮了。

07:03.332 --> 07:06.194
And I have it all to my--
oh!
我拥有这一切——
哦！

07:06.263 --> 07:07.677
[all exclaiming]
[camera shutters clicking]
[所有人惊呼]
[相机快门咔哒声]

07:07.746 --> 07:09.539
Ow!
My back!
噢！
我的背！

07:13.677 --> 07:15.918
Huh? Where is it?
啊？它在哪里？

07:15.987 --> 07:18.504
- Is this that
Babbling Buttercup
- 这是那个吗
咿咿呀呀的毛茛

07:18.573 --> 07:20.504
you were looking for?
你在找什么？

07:20.573 --> 07:23.160
[curious chattering]
[好奇的喋喋不休]

07:24.160 --> 07:27.573
- Aww, ohh.
- 哇哦。

07:28.263 --> 07:29.091
[crinkling]
[起皱]

07:29.160 --> 07:30.366
[all gasp]
[全都喘气]

07:30.435 --> 07:32.608
[groans]
[呻吟]

07:33.677 --> 07:35.711
[blows landing]
[吹着陆]

07:37.780 --> 07:38.849
- Ooh.
- 哦。

07:42.160 --> 07:43.194
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

07:45.229 --> 07:47.401
- [pained groaning]
- [痛苦的呻吟]

07:47.470 --> 07:49.091
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

07:49.160 --> 07:50.160
[sniffs]
Mmm.
[嗅嗅]
嗯。

07:50.229 --> 07:51.263
- [jibbers]
- [叽叽喳喳]

07:51.332 --> 07:53.056
[sighs] Well,
[叹气]好吧，

07:53.125 --> 07:56.194
that's one more vacation
down the drain.
这又是一个假期
付诸东流。

07:56.263 --> 07:57.987
May as well go home.
也可以回家吧。

07:58.056 --> 08:00.539
- Well, we got a long drive
ahead of us.
- 嗯，我们的车程很长
在我们前面。

08:01.539 --> 08:05.677
We better go before we go
if you know what I mean-o.
我们最好在走之前先走
如果你明白我的意思-o。

08:05.746 --> 08:07.298
- [chuckles]
- [轻笑]

08:07.366 --> 08:08.608
Uh, not really.
呃，不是真的。

08:08.677 --> 08:12.160
- Now, Squidward,
don't leave without us.
-现在，章鱼哥，
不要离开我们。

08:12.229 --> 08:14.194
- Huh?
Of course not!
- 啊？
当然不是！

08:14.263 --> 08:17.125
Only a monster
would leave you behind.
只是一个怪物
会把你抛在后面。

08:20.194 --> 08:21.815
So I'm a monster.
所以我是一个怪物。

08:23.332 --> 08:25.056
[whistling]
[吹口哨]

08:25.125 --> 08:27.608
They'll be fine...
他们会没事的...

08:27.677 --> 08:30.366
alone, on top of a mountain...
独自一人，在山顶上……

08:30.435 --> 08:32.746
in the middle of nowhere.
在偏僻的地方。

08:34.401 --> 08:35.677
Oh!
哦！

08:35.746 --> 08:37.953
Oh, I can't do it!
哦，我做不到！

08:38.022 --> 08:40.815
[boat beeping]
[船的嘟嘟声]

08:43.366 --> 08:44.711
- Hey, you're really
- 嘿，你真是

08:44.780 --> 08:46.815
getting the hang of
using toilet paper, Patrick.
掌握窍门
使用卫生纸，帕特里克。

08:46.884 --> 08:49.504
- And next week,
I'm starting on two-ply.
- 下周，
我从两层开始。

08:49.573 --> 08:53.091
- I'll get another roll
from the RV.
- 我再拿一卷
来自房车。

08:53.160 --> 08:54.401
Hey, where is the RV?
嘿，房车在哪里？

08:54.470 --> 08:56.125
- Well, maybe those guys
have seen it.
- 好吧，也许那些家伙
见过它。

08:56.194 --> 08:59.677
Hey, hey!
Have you seen our pineapple?
嘿嘿！
你看到我们的菠萝了吗？

09:02.746 --> 09:05.987
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

09:07.160 --> 09:08.160
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

09:08.229 --> 09:10.470
- Oh, no, I'm too late!
- 哦，不，我来晚了！

09:10.539 --> 09:12.953
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

09:13.022 --> 09:14.918
- Hi-yah!
- 嗨呀！

09:14.987 --> 09:18.263
Don't you dare
eat those morons!
你不敢吗
吃掉那些白痴！

09:18.332 --> 09:20.263
[both giggling]
[两人都咯咯笑]

09:20.953 --> 09:23.539
- Squidward,
they weren't eating us.
- 章鱼哥，
他们没有吃我们。

09:23.608 --> 09:26.022
- We were just having
a tickle fight.
- 我们刚刚
一场挠痒痒的战斗。

09:26.091 --> 09:29.056
- Sea-bears love it when
you tickle their bellies.
- 海熊喜欢它
你挠他们的肚子。

09:29.125 --> 09:33.263
- But they hate it when
you karate chop their heinies.
- 但他们讨厌这样
你用空手道砍掉他们的荣耀。

09:33.332 --> 09:36.539
[bear growls]
- Uh, tickle, tickle...
[熊咆哮]
- 呃，痒痒，痒痒……

09:36.608 --> 09:39.366
[loud growling]
[大声咆哮]

09:39.435 --> 09:42.539
- Squidward, they'll leave
you alone if you play dead!
- 章鱼哥，他们会离开
如果你装死，就只有你一个人了！

09:42.608 --> 09:44.194
- Uh, here!
This'll help!
- 呃，在这里！
这会有帮助的！

09:44.263 --> 09:45.539
Catch!
抓住！

09:46.711 --> 09:49.608
- [mumbling]
- [咕哝]

09:51.539 --> 09:53.953
[head squeaks]
[bear growling]
[头吱吱作响]
[熊咆哮]

09:55.125 --> 09:56.780
- Bye!
Call me.
- 再见！
打电话给我。

09:56.849 --> 09:58.953
You got my number.
你有我的号码。

10:01.401 --> 10:02.332
Wow!
哇！

10:02.401 --> 10:03.849
Was that a fun road trip
那是一次有趣的公路旅行吗

10:03.918 --> 10:06.091
or was that a fun road trip?
或者那是一次有趣的公路旅行吗？

10:08.573 --> 10:10.642
- Ha!
The funnerest!
- 哈！
最好玩的！

10:10.711 --> 10:12.815
- More like the worst
road trip.
- 更像是最糟糕的
公路旅行。

10:12.884 --> 10:16.263
My once chance to hear
the Warbling Water Lily
我一次有机会听到
鸣叫的睡莲

10:16.332 --> 10:18.642
and you ruined it!
而你毁了它！

10:20.263 --> 10:23.091
- Are you sure
about that, Squidward?
- 你确定吗
关于那件事，章鱼哥？

10:24.332 --> 10:27.366
Oh, poor thing
just needed some love.
哦，可怜的东西
只是需要一些爱。

10:27.435 --> 10:29.091
[kisses]
[亲吻]

10:29.160 --> 10:32.815
- [gasps]
The Warbling Water Lily!
- [喘气]
睡莲的鸣叫！

10:34.366 --> 10:35.987
[clarinet music]
[单簧管音乐]

10:36.056 --> 10:38.573
So beautiful.
如此美丽。

10:38.642 --> 10:41.746
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

10:41.815 --> 10:43.366
- Oh! My ears!
- 哦！我的耳朵！

10:43.435 --> 10:46.160
My ears!
It hurts! It hurts!
我的耳朵！
好痛！好痛！

10:46.229 --> 10:47.435
[boom]
[繁荣]

10:47.504 --> 10:48.780
[screams]
[尖叫声]

10:48.849 --> 10:51.677
- We're so happy for you,
Squidward!
